{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787400238101198001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"vanitied-kitschy-mantis","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"786343e0efb1ccfc1c65d255fe8d5945bfbe5bd4926e4f7cabcbe962462bf6d9","event_uuid":"cd25dbfb-461c-4142-a189-db11451be80b","position":{"commit_sha":"acddfee7f99487094526efd1f72e43950b40a7d3","position":"1787397437256325001-cd25dbfb-461c-4142-a189-db11451be80b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"69ee3021e1557e25a006f9b459a889462441696319ea98ba68b7b0d0c014e5e8","event_uuid":"866ef06e-cf8d-408b-9048-ecc7e5d53327","position":{"commit_sha":"81d711658af2e9281c129dfd58040ec5c048c3ab","position":"1787397474349287001-866ef06e-cf8d-408b-9048-ecc7e5d53327"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787397437256325001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"866ef06e-cf8d-408b-9048-ecc7e5d53327","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2399-5e49-6b28-4d59"}],"description":"## Context\nFiled from the escape analysis on marshy-chummy-coot (2399-5e49-6b28-4d59). An instrumented test run (pytest plugin hard-wiring BindingStore.is_comment_mapped to False on every loaded module copy) showed the pre-fix dedup test suite could not observe the primary skip being disabled end-to-end: the differ tests seed map state via a private _StubBindingStore (tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_comment_id_map_diff.py), while the apply tests seed synthetic id-bearing payloads. Each layer's test seeds the invariant the other layer is supposed to establish; no test crosses the seam.\n\n## Proposal (test work; operator to adjudicate priority)\nAdd one seam-crossing dedup test: drive the real apply-phase recording (_record_comment_id path) with the transport's REAL envelope shape (the ACLI batch-mutation fixture added by fix 8d98c298fa8 in test_comment_id_acli_envelope.py), against a real BindingStore instance, then run _diff_comments against that SAME store and assert the already-posted comment is skipped. A control variant asserts a not-yet-posted comment is NOT skipped.\n\nDistinct from crusty-brinish-ass (3235-8aaf-e288-48f2), which covers fixture provenance for the transport passthrough seam. This ticket tests the apply-to-differ seam using that fixture.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Test posts via the real recording path with the real envelope fixture and re-diffs against the same store instance\n- [ ] Assert skip engages for the recorded comment and does not engage for an unrecorded one\n- [ ] Test fails if is_comment_mapped is inert (verified by temporarily disabling the guard)\n\n## Non-goals\nNo new review criterion; no changes to production code.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9dc3-7d6c-83d7-41c7","ticket_type":"task","title":"Seam-crossing dedup test: real envelope through record then re-diff same store","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cd25dbfb-461c-4142-a189-db11451be80b","866ef06e-cf8d-408b-9048-ecc7e5d53327"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787400238101198001,"uuid":"b6cebfcc-2d19-44e8-9ae1-9064c48d6a4c"}